# DUB.SAR 1.0 Example: Reciprocal Table Lookup
# Difficulty: Mastery
# Concept: Archival Reference Tables & Reciprocals
# Mode: Scholar (Latin transliteration)
#
# Purpose:
#   Consults the standard immutable reference tablet 'reciprocals'
#   from the tablet archive and executes exact sexagesimal division.
#
# Expected Output:
#   0;7,30
#   3;45

problem
    consult tablet "reciprocals"

    recip_8 : take entry 8 from reciprocals

    dividend : 30
    quotient :
        dividend
        recip_8
        multiply

result
    recip_8
    quotient
